---
---

<section class="section faq">
  <div class="section-gap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="faq-wrap">
        <div class="faq-header">
          <div to-top-0="" class="faq-eyebrow">
            <div class="faq-dot"></div>
            <div class="font-extra-small faq">FAQ</div>
          </div>
          <div class="header-item-wrap">
            <div heading-rebuild="" class="max-width-60">
              <h2 class="section-heading center">Your daycare questions, answered!</h2>
            </div>
            <div to-top-2="" class="max-width-38">
              <p class="paragraph-regular center">A helpful guide to enrollment, daily routines, and getting your little one ready for daycare.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
              <div class="font-medium">How do I enroll my child at MindBlossom?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon">
                  <path d="M20.9922 12H2.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  <path d="M11.9922 4V20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="faq-icon-bar"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="paragraph-regular faq">Start by registering your interest or booking a tour. We&#x27;ll discuss your child&#x27;s needs, explore our programs together, and guide you through the next steps.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
              <div class="font-medium">Which program is right for my child?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon">
                  <path d="M20.9922 12H2.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  <path d="M11.9922 4V20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="faq-icon-bar"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="paragraph-regular faq">It depends on your child&#x27;s age and stage. Infant Care, Toddler Discovery, Preschool Play and Early Learning each follow a different rhythm, and we&#x27;ll help you pick the best fit during your tour.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
              <div class="font-medium">What does a typical day look like?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon">
                  <path d="M20.9922 12H2.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  <path d="M11.9922 4V20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="faq-icon-bar"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="paragraph-regular faq">Each day mixes free play, guided activities, outdoor time, meals and rest. Routines stay gentle and predictable, so children feel safe while they explore, create and learn.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
              <div class="font-medium">What should my child bring each day?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon">
                  <path d="M20.9922 12H2.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  <path d="M11.9922 4V20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="faq-icon-bar"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="paragraph-regular faq">Pack a change of clothes, a water bottle, any comfort item for nap time and weather-ready outerwear. We&#x27;ll share a simple checklist when you enroll, based on your child&#x27;s program.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
              <div class="font-medium">How do you help children settle in?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon">
                  <path d="M20.9922 12H2.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  <path d="M11.9922 4V20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="faq-icon-bar"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="paragraph-regular faq">We start with short visits and build up slowly. Caregivers learn your child&#x27;s routines and comforts, and we keep you updated so the first weeks feel calm for the whole family.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div to-top-2="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
              <div class="font-medium">How can I learn about tuition and availability?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon-box"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="faq-icon">
                  <path d="M20.9922 12H2.99219" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  <path d="M11.9922 4V20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="faq-icon-bar"></path>
                </svg></div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="paragraph-regular faq">Get in touch or book a tour, and our team will share current fees, open spots and start dates for each program. We&#x27;re happy to answer any questions along the way.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
